{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An eclipse has blocked out the sun and in the perpetual darkness monsters have risen from the shadows.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A small tribe of people have traveled to a ancient dungeon where legend tells of a permanent source of light.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You must make your way through the winding and crumbling ruins, your only weapon a torch. However, when your torch eventually burns out the shadow will take you. Before that happens you must find a way to help those who will come after you.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Flame in the Dark is played 1 torch at a time. You must explore the dungeon and unlock ways and passages before your torch runs out, so the next torch bearer can get even deeper; and closer to their salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is dark and you only have a single torch to light your way. Explore, solve puzzles, and use your time wisely because time is always running out...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Sun Has Gone Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711530/da3a221bfd792d0487ff4c942660d34abd1a1f25.jpg"},{"name":"Going the Distance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711530/b24afcc801243315fdfe65cdda223a6e0a769245.jpg"},{"name":"Going for Speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711530/b0d3fd05f0a8f686bdeaf8ed4599bfafd9b4f54a.jpg"},{"name":"Making the Grade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711530/20bcbe41ef4c1eaa482910227de580f679d103c5.jpg"},{"name":"The Green Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711530/c9b13fcc46e81be2a6c7246718163c4881f20d81.jpg"},{"name":"Plotting the Course","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c